From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Austin Shirley <austin@deadband.dev>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 11:30:38 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(st): skip HW_CONFIG when absent from FW_CONFIG

Skip HW_CONFIG when the dtb registry has no entry for it, as already
done for TOS_FW_CONFIG on STM32MP1.

Previously, without a hw-config node in FW_CONFIG, the FW_CONFIG
post-load loop asks fconf for it and prints "FCONF: Invalid config id 2"
on every boot, although the image is unused.

Tested on STM32MP135.

Change-Id: I66a53d58b9e8707598c2b9a264d640a33b1e00ed
Upstream: https://review.trustedfirmware.org/q/I66a53d58b9e8707598c2b9a264d640a33b1e00ed
Signed-off-by: Austin Shirley <austin@deadband.dev>
---
 plat/st/stm32mp1/bl2_plat_setup.c | 8 ++++----
 plat/st/stm32mp2/bl2_plat_setup.c | 6 ++++++
 2 files changed, 10 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/plat/st/stm32mp1/bl2_plat_setup.c b/plat/st/stm32mp1/bl2_plat_setup.c
index 6e8b5d4f3a..fd75fe2fa3 100644
--- a/plat/st/stm32mp1/bl2_plat_setup.c
+++ b/plat/st/stm32mp1/bl2_plat_setup.c
@@ -409,7 +409,6 @@ int bl2_plat_handle_post_image_load(unsigned int image_id)
 	const struct dyn_cfg_dtb_info_t *config_info;
 	bl_mem_params_node_t *tos_fw_mem_params;
 	unsigned int i;
-	unsigned int idx;
 	unsigned long long ddr_top __unused;
 	const unsigned int image_ids[] = {
 		BL32_IMAGE_ID,
@@ -433,11 +432,12 @@ int bl2_plat_handle_post_image_load(unsigned int image_id)
 				FW_CONFIG_ID);
 		fconf_populate("FW_CONFIG", STM32MP_FW_CONFIG_BASE);
 
-		idx = dyn_cfg_dtb_info_get_index(TOS_FW_CONFIG_ID);
-
 		/* Iterate through all the fw config IDs */
 		for (i = 0U; i < ARRAY_SIZE(image_ids); i++) {
-			if ((image_ids[i] == TOS_FW_CONFIG_ID) && (idx == FCONF_INVALID_IDX)) {
+			/* HW_CONFIG and TOS_FW_CONFIG are optional */
+			if (((image_ids[i] == HW_CONFIG_ID) ||
+			     (image_ids[i] == TOS_FW_CONFIG_ID)) &&
+			    (dyn_cfg_dtb_info_get_index(image_ids[i]) == FCONF_INVALID_IDX)) {
 				continue;
 			}
 
diff --git a/plat/st/stm32mp2/bl2_plat_setup.c b/plat/st/stm32mp2/bl2_plat_setup.c
index 7962a97a99..2d971c218f 100644
--- a/plat/st/stm32mp2/bl2_plat_setup.c
+++ b/plat/st/stm32mp2/bl2_plat_setup.c
@@ -302,6 +302,12 @@ int bl2_plat_handle_post_image_load(unsigned int image_id)
 
 		/* Iterate through all the fw config IDs */
 		for (i = 0U; i < ARRAY_SIZE(image_ids); i++) {
+			/* HW_CONFIG is optional */
+			if ((image_ids[i] == HW_CONFIG_ID) &&
+			    (dyn_cfg_dtb_info_get_index(image_ids[i]) == FCONF_INVALID_IDX)) {
+				continue;
+			}
+
 			bl_mem_params = get_bl_mem_params_node(image_ids[i]);
 			assert(bl_mem_params != NULL);
 
